              },
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "The girls go on a boat into the dark cave. The lights from the glow-worm are very beautiful and it is very quiet. Suddenly, there is a beep from Michael’s mobile. The lights go dark. The people in the boat are angry. “No mobiles!” they say. “We’re very sorry,” Sarah says. She sees a new message for Michael. “Perhaps we can find him in Rotorua.”"
                }
